## seize_investment_pool
Seize investment pool for the treasury and transfer all private construction queue elements to the government queue = bool
**Supported Scopes**: country  

## send_interface_message
Runs the contained effects in the current scope and shows the player a message  
send_interface_message = {  
	title = loc_key		# localized against the current scope  
	desc = loc_key		# optional, replaces the child effect description, localized against the current scope  
	icon = texture		# optional, path to a texture shown on the toast  
	# any number of effects, executed in the current scope  
}
**Supported Scopes**: none  

